{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">2013 AMC 12B #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">2013 AMC 10B #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When counting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1038785e77cdf7734f6ee2f8fed6de2ab19acc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$201$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c8b693b593c77bc5471fcffa9ee077101694c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$51^{\\text{st}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> number counted. When counting backwards from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1038785e77cdf7734f6ee2f8fed6de2ab19acc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$201$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f0b29305e947b3755e0703980ff2aa077e72d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> number counted. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1dab698153c6ec810497accca49f4a598fa7255a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 146 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 147 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 148 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 149 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to the number of integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1038785e77cdf7734f6ee2f8fed6de2ab19acc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$201$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, inclusive. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/bec5001b198af054d9cc9223b42ead2ef7d6a06b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=201-53+1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 149}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"232\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B\">2013 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B 